    <title>open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet-contrib - Releases - 2026-09-24</title>
    <id>https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet-contrib#2026-09-24</id>
    <link href="https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet-contrib" />
    <updated>2026-09-25T00:10:48Z</updated>
    <content type="html">
                &lt;div&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet-contrib/releases/tag/Resources.Gcp-1.0.0-alpha.7"&gt;Resources.Gcp-1.0.0-alpha.7&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;NuGet: &lt;a href="https://www.nuget.org/packages/OpenTelemetry.Resources.Gcp/1.0.0-alpha.7" rel="nofollow"&gt;OpenTelemetry.Resources.Gcp v1.0.0-alpha.7&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The minimum supported version of &lt;code&gt;Google.Api.Gax&lt;/code&gt; is now &lt;code&gt;4.14.0&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;br&gt;
(&lt;a href="https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet-contrib/pull/5212" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet-contrib/pull/5212/hovercard"&gt;#5212&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fixed a &lt;code&gt;NullReferenceException&lt;/code&gt; thrown by the resource detector, which&lt;br&gt;
caused provider construction to fail when running as a Google Cloud Run job&lt;br&gt;
with &lt;code&gt;Google.Api.Gax&lt;/code&gt; 4.14.0 or later. Cloud Run jobs are now detected&lt;br&gt;
(&lt;code&gt;cloud.platform&lt;/code&gt; is &lt;code&gt;gcp_cloud_run&lt;/code&gt;) with the &lt;code&gt;faas.name&lt;/code&gt;,&lt;br&gt;
&lt;code&gt;gcp.cloud_run.job.execution&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;gcp.cloud_run.job.task_index&lt;/code&gt; attributes.&lt;br&gt;
(&lt;a href="https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet-contrib/pull/5212" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet-contrib/pull/5212/hovercard"&gt;#5212&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The detector now catches and logs an exception and returns an empty resource.&lt;br&gt;
(&lt;a href="https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet-contrib/pull/5212" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet-contrib/pull/5212/hovercard"&gt;#5212&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;See &lt;a href="https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet-contrib/blob/Resources.Gcp-1.0.0-alpha.7/src/OpenTelemetry.Resources.Gcp/CHANGELOG.md"&gt;CHANGELOG&lt;/a&gt; for details.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
                            &lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;/article&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet-contrib/releases/tag/Resources.Azure-1.19.1-beta.2"&gt;Resources.Azure-1.19.1-beta.2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;NuGet: &lt;a href="https://www.nuget.org/packages/OpenTelemetry.Resources.Azure/1.19.1-beta.2" rel="nofollow"&gt;OpenTelemetry.Resources.Azure v1.19.1-beta.2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add &lt;code&gt;cloud.account.id&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;azure.resource_group.name&lt;/code&gt; attributes to the Azure&lt;br&gt;
VM resource detector.&lt;br&gt;
(&lt;a href="https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet-contrib/pull/5195" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet-contrib/pull/5195/hovercard"&gt;#5195&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;See &lt;a href="https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet-contrib/blob/Resources.Azure-1.19.1-beta.2/src/OpenTelemetry.Resources.Azure/CHANGELOG.md"&gt;CHANGELOG&lt;/a&gt; for details.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
                            &lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;/article&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet-contrib/releases/tag/Instrumentation.EntityFrameworkCore-1.19.1-beta.1"&gt;Instrumentation.EntityFrameworkCore-1.19.1-beta.1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;NuGet: &lt;a href="https://www.nuget.org/packages/OpenTelemetry.Instrumentation.EntityFrameworkCore/1.19.1-beta.1" rel="nofollow"&gt;OpenTelemetry.Instrumentation.EntityFrameworkCore v1.19.1-beta.1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Updated OpenTelemetry core component version(s) to &lt;code&gt;1.19.1&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;br&gt;
(&lt;a href="https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet-contrib/pull/5329" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet-contrib/pull/5329/hovercard"&gt;#5329&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fixed query sanitization so that backslash-escaped quotes (&lt;code&gt;'a\'b'&lt;/code&gt;) in&lt;br&gt;
MySQL/MariaDB string literals and PostgreSQL dollar-quoted strings&lt;br&gt;
(&lt;code&gt;$$...$$&lt;/code&gt;) are correctly redacted.&lt;br&gt;
(&lt;a href="https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet-contrib/pull/4986" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet-contrib/pull/4986/hovercard"&gt;#4986&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fixed query sanitization so that MySQL/MariaDB double-quoted string&lt;br&gt;
literals (&lt;code&gt;"..."&lt;/code&gt;, valid when &lt;code&gt;ANSI_QUOTES&lt;/code&gt; is disabled) are correctly&lt;br&gt;
redacted.&lt;br&gt;
(&lt;a href="https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet-contrib/pull/4986" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet-contrib/pull/4986/hovercard"&gt;#4986&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;See &lt;a href="https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet-contrib/blob/Instrumentation.EntityFrameworkCore-1.19.1-beta.1/src/OpenTelemetry.Instrumentation.EntityFrameworkCore/CHANGELOG.md"&gt;CHANGELOG&lt;/a&gt; for details.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
                            &lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;/article&gt;
                    
                &lt;/div&gt;
